//==
// # Version 1 gate witnesses (TKT-418)
//
// A model meshed once per sweep through the refinement loop, with quads preferred, so the gate
// laws of the version 1 mesh contract (sandbox/step-brep-mesh/README.md, "Version 1 mesh
// contract") read real face meshes: closed, oriented, covering, within the chordal tolerance.
// The law runner builds every Witness_* of this type once and exhausts the list; the type is not
// generatable, since it holds a BrepModel.

// Model, named Name, meshed under Options to the final state of layer 08's refinement loop with
// every face chosen and no validation.
// Invariants: State is Model.FinalState(Options, Model.AllFaces); Options.Face.PreferQuads.
type V1GateWitness
{
    Name: String;
    Model: BrepModel;
    Options: MeshingOptions;
    State: PipelineState;
}
